  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Lyncan have adapted the weapons of the people they’ve integrated with, but many have grown accustomed wielding weapons that play to their graceful forms and ferocious strength. You gain access to all uncommon weapons with the lyncan trait. You have familiarity with weapons with the lyncan trait plus the lion scythe, rapier, whipstaff and kama – for the purpose of determining your proficiency, martial lyncan weapons are simple weapons and advanced lyncan weapons are martial weapons.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">At 5th level, whenever you get a critical hit with one of these weapons, you get its critical specialization effect.</span></p>"
